        "heading": "What is Phenibut?",
        "disclaimer": "Educational only. Not medical advice.",
        "opening": "Phenibut is a synthetic compound related to GABA, a chemical messenger in the nervous system.",
        "body": "<p>It is offered here in two chemical forms, HCl and FAA, and as capsules or powder. Published discussion often focuses on GABA-B receptor activity. That description of chemistry is not a claim about a typical customer result.</p>",
